# reflect: optional project settings. Copy to .env (which git ignores) if you want any of them.
# reflect reads only ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and REFLECT_* from this file, and the environment always wins.

# API key for the judge and reflection calls. Not needed if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set in your
# environment, you set it in the plugin's settings, or you use `ant auth login`.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Trigger policy: k2w6 (default: 2 pushbacks within 6 of your messages), k2w4, k2w8, k3w8,
# k2w6-med (only medium or high confidence verdicts count), each (every pushback).
# REFLECT_POLICY=k2w6

# Reflection model and effort (low, medium, high, xhigh, max).
# REFLECT_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# REFLECT_EFFORT=high

# Per-message judge.
# REFLECT_JUDGE_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5

# Stop calling the API in a session once it has cost this much (USD).
# REFLECT_MAX_USD_PER_SESSION=0.5

# 1 turns every reflect hook into a no-op. `reflect off` does the same for one project.
# REFLECT_DISABLED=1
